ます。\n\n暑い日々が続いております。先生のますますのご健康とご活躍をお祈り申し上げます。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Kaiju_ryoku08/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 508832, "client_id": 1684013, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/68b4b0f1/uploads/origins/5ef727d7-67ab-43a3-8f24-0dd35021da1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=94a303a8a7f5da8a806e02272306809c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/68b4b0f1/uploads/origins/5ef727d7-67ab-43a3-8f24-0dd35021da1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=94a303a8a7f5da8a806e02272306809c, https://si.imgix.net/68b4b0f1/uploads/origins/5ef727d7-67ab-43a3-8f24-0dd35021da1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e014cb8d763a3428acf0d47a6062a38 2x, https://si.imgix.net/68b4b0f1/uploads/origins/5ef727d7-67ab-43a3-8f24-0dd35021da1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2bb7500bb80cb8791440c34415360d44 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/68b4b0f1/uploads/origins/5ef727d7-67ab-43a3-8f24-0dd35021da1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0d869be360b4d9fea3d9170b7daab26b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/68b4b0f1/uploads/origins/5ef727d7-67ab-43a3-8f24-0dd35021da1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0d869be360b4d9fea3d9170b7daab26b, https://si.imgix.net/68b4b0f1/uploads/origins/5ef727d7-67ab-43a3-8f24-0dd35021da1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2d03839c6927ea1a16a150e4129f9364 2x, https://si.imgix.net/68b4b0f1/uploads/origins/5ef727d7-67ab-43a3-8f24-0dd35021da1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9b27853e13d2775c8f78815ef07692c6 3x"}, "body": "怪重力先生はじめまして！nukunukuと申します。Xで先生の絵を見てリクエストを申したいと思い、今回申請することになりました。今回先生にリクエストしたいイラストはVtuber 할리스원더 ハリス・ワンダー(@HaliceWonder)さんの新衣装お祝いイラストをお願いしたいです！あまり絵に関する知識が無くて衣装以外はすべて先生のお任せになってしまいますが、ご検討宜しくお願い致します。", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Kaiju_ryoku08/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 508832, "client_id": 3049910, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a796fcc9/uploads/origins/c99be1c7-23c8-4cdd-b780-c05038dd202f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=956d9f8ca6a4990066f0adc858d04dfe", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a796fcc9/uploads/origins/c99be1c7-23c8-4cdd-b780-c05038dd202f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=956d9f8ca6a4990066f0adc858d04dfe, https://si.imgix.net/a796fcc9/uploads/origins/c99be1c7-23c8-4cdd-b780-c05038dd202f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b7f9913ff08dbeca8eb8fed605cb8f8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a796fcc9/uploads/origins/c99be1c7-23c8-4cdd-b780-c05038dd202f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d1681f441683e0bca142793ca99b3b54 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a796fcc9/uploads/origins/c99be1c7-23c8-4cdd-b780-c05038dd202f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4f2e50977e4b8bb37e8a8821e69469ee", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a796fcc9/uploads/origins/c99be1c7-23c8-4cdd-b780-c05038dd202f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4f2e50977e4b8bb37e8a8821e69469ee, https://si.imgix.net/a796fcc9/uploads/origins/c99be1c7-23c8-4cdd-b780-c05038dd202f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&